both use core.operations.publication_phase (standard library only).
read_phase re-exports invalidate_publication unchanged. Import cycles in core/
go from 2 to 1 (tools/claude_import_cycles.py in Core); full suite unchanged
(2638 passed, 15 skipped, 5 xfailed on 587d4a9).

